          %p
            An
            %em asymptotically locally Euclidean space
            or
            %em ALE space
            for short is a solution to the Euclidean
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Einstein+equations"} Einstein equations
            which is a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/blow-up"} blow-up
            of an
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/ADE-orbifold"} ADE-orbifold
            singularity
